    <div class="container blog-wrap">
      <header class="art-hdr">
        <div class="art-meta"><span class="badge badge-blue">Finance Guide</span><span class="art-date">July 4, 2026 · 6 min read</span></div>
        <h1>Quotex Deposit and Withdrawal Guide 2026</h1>
        <p class="art-lead">Everything you need to know about deposits and withdrawals on Quotex — minimum amounts, payment methods, processing times, limits and step-by-step instructions for withdrawing your profits.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="art-body">
        <h2>Quotex Minimum Deposit</h2>
        <p>The minimum deposit on Quotex is <strong>$10 USD</strong>. This is one of the lowest minimums in the binary options industry, making Quotex accessible to traders with small budgets who want to try live trading after practicing on demo.</p>
        <div class="callout info"><strong>💡 Recommendation:</strong> Always practice on the free Quotex demo account first. Only deposit real money once you've tested your strategy with Quotex Bot on demo and achieved consistent results over at least 200 trades.</div>
        <h2>Quotex Deposit Methods</h2>
