          <li><strong>Bank cards:</strong> Visa and Mastercard — instant processing</li>
          <li><strong>Cryptocurrency:</strong> Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), USDT, Litecoin — fast processing</li>
          <li><strong>E-wallets:</strong> Perfect Money, Skrill, Neteller, WebMoney</li>
          <li><strong>Local methods:</strong> Varies by country — bank transfer, mobile payment, etc.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How to Deposit on Quotex</h2>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li>Log in to your account at qxbroker.com</li>
          <li>Click on your balance or the Deposit button</li>
          <li>Select your preferred payment method</li>
          <li>Enter the deposit amount (minimum $10)</li>
          <li>Enter promo code if you have one</li>
          <li>Complete payment — funds appear instantly for most methods</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Quotex Minimum Withdrawal</h2>
        <p>The minimum withdrawal amount on Quotex is <strong>$10 USD</strong>. You must withdraw using the same method you used to deposit (this is standard practice to prevent money laundering).</p>
        <h2>Quotex Withdrawal Limit</h2>
        <p>Withdrawal limits vary by payment method and account verification level:</p>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li><strong>Standard accounts:</strong> Up to $5,000 per day</li>
          <li><strong>Verified accounts:</strong> Higher limits available on request</li>
          <li><strong>Cryptocurrency:</strong> Often has higher limits than cards</li>
          <li><strong>Bonus funds:</strong> Cannot be withdrawn until volume requirements met</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How to Withdraw Money from Quotex</h2>
        <ul class="art-list">
          <li>Complete KYC verification first (required for all withdrawals)</li>
          <li>Log in to your account at qxbroker.com</li>
          <li>Go to Withdrawal section in your profile</li>
          <li>Select the same payment method used for deposit</li>
          <li>Enter withdrawal amount (minimum $10)</li>
          <li>Confirm your request</li>
          <li>Wait 1-5 business days for processing</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Quotex Withdrawal Processing Time</h2>
        <ul class="art-list">
